---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/legal.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund Policy — wArcxs" description="Refund Policy for wArcxs.">
  <div class="legal">
    <header class="ltop">
      <a class="wm" href="/"><span class="lm">wArcxs</span></a>
      <a class="back" href="/">← Back</a>
    </header>
    <main class="lmain">
      <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="upd">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <p>This policy explains refunds for wArcxs products and services. It's part of our
        <a href="/legal/terms">terms of service</a> and applies to every product we offer, except where a product's own
        pages state otherwise.</p>

      <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
      <p>You can cancel a plan at any time from your account's billing. When you cancel, you keep access until the end of
        the period you've already paid for, and you are not charged again. We do not provide partial refunds for the
        unused part of a billing period.</p>

      <h2>One-off purchases</h2>
      <p>One-off purchases, such as token packs, never expire. Once added to your balance they are
        <strong>non-refundable</strong>, since they are immediately available to spend.</p>

      <h2>Fair exceptions</h2>
      <p>If you were charged in error, charged twice, or a Service was materially unavailable and prevented you from
        using what you paid for, contact us — we'll make it right. Requests are handled case by case.</p>

      <h2>How to request</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@warcxs.com">hello@warcxs.com</a> from your account email with your details and
        what happened.</p>
    </main>
    <footer class="lfoot">
      <span>2026 wArcxs &mdash; &copy; All rights reserved</span>
      <nav><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/legal/terms">Terms</a><a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/legal/refunds">Refunds</a></nav>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
